.TH SFCLI 1 "" "Seafield Cluster" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sfcli \- manage a Seafield Cluster
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sfcli
.I resource verb
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sfcli
manages a Seafield Cluster: servers, apps, volumes, networks, images and
users. It talks to
.BR sfcd (8)
over the local management socket
.I /run/sfcdp.sock
or a remote context saved in
.IR ~/.sfc .
Run
.B sfcli \-\-help
for the command list and
.B sfcli
.I resource
.B \-\-help
for one resource.
.PP
AI agents read
.I SKILL.md
in the share/sfc directory of the installation before running sfcli.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SFC_NONINTERACTIVE=1
never ask for a password or a confirmation.
.TP
.B SFC_WALLET_PASSWORD_FILE
read the wallet password from this file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sfcd (8),
https://github.com/jay94ks/seafield/tree/main/docs/cli
